+
+Implement JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386): export `applyMergePatch(target, patch)` from `src/index.ts`.
+Non-object patches replace the target; object patches merge member by member, `null` removes a member,
+and non-object targets are treated as `{}`. Inputs are not mutated, and non-JSON values are rejected as in
+`applyPatch`. Tests cover the RFC's examples.
diff --git a/src/index.test.ts b/src/index.test.ts
index d026ec7619c695e8528bfce2120b9ef497a57d83..832a8e78d0a63071c4aead74b8d472970913cc82 100644
